rb","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"奉弟封"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-055","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-dingfeng","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-055-dingfeng","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-dingfeng:line138","quote":"休薨，奉與丞相濮陽興等從萬彧之言，共迎立孫皓，遷右大司馬左軍師。寶鼎三年，皓命奉與諸葛靚攻合肥。奉與晉大將石苞書，搆而間之，苞以徵還。建衡元年，奉復帥衆治徐塘，因攻晉穀陽。穀陽民知之，引去，奉無所獲。皓怒，斬奉導軍。三年，卒。奉貴而有功，漸以驕矜，或有毀之者，皓追以前出軍事，徙奉家於臨川。奉弟封，官至後將軍，先奉死。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-dingfeng:line138:m0147","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-dingfeng:line138:m0003"}],"interpretation_note":"以此來源所述兩端為據。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-wu055-dingfeng3","person_id":"x3e_y4j_wv5","event_type":"death","source_term":"先奉死","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-055","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-dingfeng","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-055-dingfeng","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-dingfeng:line138","quote":"休薨，奉與丞相濮陽興等從萬彧之言，共迎立孫皓，遷右大司馬左軍師。寶鼎三年，皓命奉與諸葛靚攻合肥。奉與晉大將石苞書，搆而間之，苞以徵還。建衡元年，奉復帥衆治徐塘，因攻晉穀陽。穀陽民知之，引去，奉無所獲。皓怒，斬奉導軍。三年，卒。奉貴而有功，漸以驕矜，或有毀之者，皓追以前出軍事，徙奉家於臨川。奉弟封，官至後將軍，先奉死。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-dingfeng:line138:m0147"}],"interpretation_note":"本來源所記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-055-dingfeng:line138:m0147","surface":"封","start":147,"end":148,"kind":"person","person_id":"x3e_y4j_wv5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段具名及前後親稱、官職定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-dingfeng:line138","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-dingfeng"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-wu055-dingfeng-0","subject_person_id":"x3e_y4j_wv5","object_person_id":"nd1_eoc_wrb","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"sou